    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Unfortunately, I cannot do divination to tell you what it is without a <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mwe.html\">#mwe</a></p>",
        "id": 601351886,
        "sender_full_name": "Yaël Dillies",
        "timestamp": 1780991894
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>Well, in fact, here I can, but that's not the point <span aria-label=\"genie\" class=\"emoji emoji-1f9de\" role=\"img\" title=\"genie\">:genie:</span></p>",
        "id": 601351969,
