    {
        "content": "<p><span class=\"user-mention silent\" data-user-id=\"387244\">Yaël Dillies</span> <a href=\"#narrow/channel/113489-new-members/topic/understanding.20some.20type.20coersion/near/601353759\">said</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>So what is the function you found in the infoview? :)</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I'm not sure how to see that. when I click on the upwords arrow I see a general message about type coersion.</p>",
        "id": 601354497,
